                                "sense_id": "15e3dade-78ae-3dcb-ba70-9512cc6c7492",
                                "text": "Then suddenly — Zam! Zowie! Smash! The Post sends back an article which I was positive it would buy, and which, in fact, it had ordered. One manuscript after another is flung back into my face […]"
